T2 parity = the compiled program's accuracy on convention cases; Sen/Jun conv = share of seniors / juniors who hold the convention; Sen/Jun reg = share who hold the registry;
Unknowing% = hard cases (Tiers 2 and 3) whose signing professional lacked the component the case required, as a share of hard cases; Unk err% = the errors among them;
Settle hard err% = errors on settled hard cases as a share of all hard cases; Escal. = overt precedent memos routed to a registry holder; Defer = reviewers deferring to a handler they did not know.
